    "text": "A subnormal subgroup H◁◁ G of a group G is said to be good if and only if\n⟨H, J⟩ ◁◁ G whenever J◁◁ G. Is it true that when H and K are good subnormal\nsubgroups of G, then H ∩ K is good?                            J. G. Thompson",
